// Deserialization safety classes that still count as unsafe.
//
// OTP's docs for binary_to_term/2 say `safe` prevents new atoms and new
// external function references, then warn that it "does not guarantee
// that the data is safe for your application": a fun referencing an
// already-loaded module passes. Paginator CVE-2020-15150 was RCE through
// `[:safe]`, a client-supplied cursor decoded to a fun that Enumerable
// then invoked. `[:safe]` downgrades; it does not clear. Only
// Plug.Crypto's term-walking decoders, recorded as "validated", clear it.
//
// Requires imports.dl.

.decl unsafe_safety_class(safety: symbol)

unsafe_safety_class("unsafe").
unsafe_safety_class("atoms_only").
unsafe_safety_class("dynamic").
